# Measured SM5 tiled-resources opcode numbers -- fxc 10.1 (Windows SDK
# 10.0.26100) on winoracle, 2026-11-03.
#
# Reproduce:
#   scp -4 tools/oracle_probe/dxbc_tiled_opcode_probe.hlsl winoracle:tprobe.hlsl
#   ssh -4 winoracle '& "C:\Program Files (x86)\Windows Kits\10\bin\10.0.26100.0\x64\fxc.exe" \
#       /nologo /T ps_5_0 /E main /Od /Fc tprobe.asm /Fo tprobe.cso tprobe.hlsl'
#   scp -4 winoracle:tprobe.asm winoracle:tprobe.cso .
#   python3 tools/oracle_probe/dxbc_tiled_operand_decode.py tprobe.cso
#
# The /Fc listing and the decode pair one-to-one (178 instructions).
#
# Encoding (every _s opcode): operand 0 is the destination, operand 1 the
# status destination -- a temp with a one-component mask (.x), or a NULL
# operand (type 13) when the HLSL call passes no status -- then the base
# instruction's operands. The *_cl_s forms end with the MinLOD clamp, a
# scalar (select-1 source or immediate). fxc never emits a separate `_cl`
# opcode: Sample(s, uv, off, clamp) is sample_cl_s with a NULL status, and
# Sample(s, uv, off, 0.0f, st) is sample_cl_s with clamp l(0.0).
# check_access_fully_mapped: dest (.x mask), src (select-1).
#
# mnemonic                    opcode
gather4_s                       219
gather4_c_s                     220
gather4_po_s                    221
gather4_po_c_s                  222
ld_s                            223   (texture2d and buffer)
ldms_s                          224
ld_uav_typed_s                  225   (texture2d and buffer UAVs)
ld_raw_s                        226   (SRV and UAV)
ld_structured_s                 227   (SRV and UAV)
sample_l_s                      228
sample_c_lz_s                   229
sample_cl_s                     230   (texture2d, 2darray, cube, 3d)
sample_b_cl_s                   231
sample_d_cl_s                   232
sample_c_cl_s                   233
check_access_fully_mapped       234
